egory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":329,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1785110400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.976744186046512,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":329}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EnduForce_600_1_Alternative1","description":"Cette séance comporte un total de 5 intervalles à très haute intensité, séparés par 3' de récupération à allure très lente ou marchée pour récupérer totalement avant de repartir sur le sprint suivant. \nLa durée des 5 sprints forme une pyramide qui s'enchaine de la manière suivante : 15\" 25\" 35\" 25\" 15\".","displayName":"Endurance de Force","coachAdvice":"Tu découvres peut-être pour la première fois cet effort. Le repos peut paraître long sur le papier. Mais sur le terrain, si on se donne vraiment à fond, on aimerait que ça dure plus longtemps. Savoure-en chaque seconde.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":329,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"FORCE_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_3","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":600,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":