,{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_25","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Un doute par rapport à une fatigue ou une douleur anormale ? N'hésite pas à écourter la durée de ce footing afin de bien récupérer pendant ta semaine de récupération !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_25","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":25,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":4.373177842565598,"expectedDuration":1500},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1500,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_30_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Quelques lignes droites en plus du traditionnel footing. De quoi te faire plaisir car il n'y a aucun objectif d'allure, juste de sentir que ton corps se libère et te permet d'accélérer progressivement de ligne droite en ligne droite !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":193,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":5.116076989108698,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":193}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":598}},{"kind":"Z2","duration":240,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 4 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 3 blocs. Les deux premiers blocs sont composés de 3 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le troisième bloc est composé de 2 séries de 2x2 exercices différents alternés, enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1 et 2, et 2' entre les séries du bloc 3. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Le renforcement est un complément à la course, pas une compétition. Le lendemain de ta séance, tu ne dois pas être cassé en deux (même sur les séances les plus difficiles). Alors si tu te sens épuisé, n'hésite pas à utiliser une variante d'exercice plus simple sur quelques répétitions par série.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Extension de Mollet","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":15,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 2 pieds","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"LRwmfIIbjAq00CUzgNV9QJD00cjxpce6mY","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"wEJw8kcN6TSOZ2k7EYrOxnzFlrfkS3XX","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 1 pied","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394758-dsc4263.png","muxPlaybackId":"1R00Rw81qTAo69DGhdMVO1ZhipUK5euzU","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://image.mux.com/dlCX