duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Footing en endurance fondamentale. L'impression en fin de séance doit être celle d'être plus en forme qu'avant de l'avoir commencée. Tu ne dois pas te fatiguer sur cette séance, juste enchaîner les kilomètres sans stress !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1789948800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.038123167155425,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Var_VMA_S30_T_600_1","description":"Séance de variation d'allure avec 2 blocs courus en continu. Première partie du bloc constituée de 30\" à ton allure VMA directement enchaînées par la deuxième partie et son 2' à ton Seuil 30 pour finir (toujours sans pause) par 6' à ton allure Tempo. Tes 5' de récupération sont bien méritées avant d'attaquer le bloc suivant !","displayName":"Variation de vitesse","coachAdvice":"Séance surprenante au programme si tu n'en as jamais fait, cette séance de 'variation d'allure' démarre sur un gros rythme à VMA et continue directement sur du Seuil 30... avant de terminer par ton allure Tempo, proche de ton allure marathon, qui devrait presque paraître \"lente\" par rapport à ce que tu as couru juste avant ! Fais attention à ne pas courir trop vite une fois passée l'intervalle à VMA sinon la fin de séance sera longue... Ce type de séance est assez intense, c'est pour ça qu'on te donne beaucoup de repos pour bien récupérer entre chaque bloc, profites-en, souffle bien et prépare-toi à te donner pour l'intervalle suivant !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"VMA_0.5","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VMA","value":211,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"vma"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":241,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_6","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":298,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":6,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1789948800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.974910569897002,"expectedDuration":2820},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":900,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":360,"pace":{"value":298}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":30,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":120,"pace":{"value":241}},{"kind":"Z3","duration":360,"pace":{"value":298}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":326}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":300,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_80_HARD_2","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 25' Tempo en continu.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Une autre \"petite\" sortie longue de 1h20. On est loin du marathon, on ne cherche pas forcément à faire des sorties très longues, 1h20 c'est bien suffisant à ce moment de ta préparation !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_45","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":1,"exercises":