,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Les footings, c'est la base de l'entraînement, tu en retrouveras donc chaque semaine, c'est ce qui te permettra de faire un bon kilométrage chaque semaine sans générer trop de fatigue et donc en évitant un maximum les blessures !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1790553600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.9178885630498534,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_5_Alternative1","description":"Séance de S60, en variation d'allure, composée de **5 séries**. Chaque série est composée **1' au S30, 2' au S60 et 2' au SweetSpot, enchainé sans repos**. La série se clôture par **2' de récupération**, avant de passer à la série suivante. ","displayName":"Séance S60 alternative : \"Attention aux Baïnes\"","coachAdvice":"Une séance qui permet de balayer un bel éventail de vitesse. Parfait pour apprendre à gérer ses allures et surtout pour apprendre à se connaitre. Donc si tu maitrises mal tes allures, tu vas très certainement partir trop vite. Ce sera un mal pour un bien, tu vas apprendre et c'est aussi le but de l'entrainement.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":241,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":254,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"SweetSpot_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Sweet spot","value":266,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"sweet-spot"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":595,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1790553600000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a674fe00462290c63a36f11","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1790553600000,"sessionIndex":2,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"da