 place à 1 pied","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730152399-dsc3808.png","muxPlaybackId":"M5026Ab3Q401vJOFGhcl12k2vHGGcBQTdL","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730152399-dsc3808.png","muxPlaybackId":"F7y9xZJd7bQBiTwtbhIrhoGpSQkNRTDQ","format":"mobile"}]}],"gear":"nothing","name":"Bond sur place"}},{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Récupération","exerciseType":"recuperation","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"recovery","repeat":1,"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[],"gear":"nothing","name":""}}]}],"status":"todo","difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1790553600000,"sport":"ppg","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"L'envie d'accélérer sur les footings ? Elle est naturelle, on l'a tous car le footing c'est facile ! Mais il faut absolument te retenir de le faire si tu veux progresser ! Courir plus vite, c'est générer de la fatigue (même un peu) qui va t'empêcher d'être à 100% sur la séance d'intensité suivante... et donc minimiser les progrès de celle-ci ! (je me répète, mais c'est important !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":326,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1790553600000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.9178885630498534,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":326}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Var_VMA_S30_T_600_2","description":"Séance de variation d'allure avec 3 blocs courus en continu. Première partie du bloc constituée de 30\" à ton allure VMA directement enchaînée par la deuxième partie et son 2' à ton Seuil 30 pour finir (toujours sans pause) par 6' à ton allure Tempo. Tes 5' de récupération sont bien méritées avant d'attaquer le bloc suivant !","displayName":"Variation de vitesse","coachAdvice":"Même séance de variation d'allure que la semaine passée... mais avec un bloc supplémentaire ! 2 blocs c'était relativement abordable, le 3ème devrait être celui qui va te challenger !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":