{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Le mot d'ordre ? RÉCUPÈRE ! Donc sur cette sortie on fait juste tourner les jambes pour garder le corps habitué à courir mais on veut revenir frais, sans avoir forcé à aucun moment !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":324,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.079646017699115,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":324}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Comme l'indique la description de l'entrainement, si jamais tu te sens très fatigué(e), n'hésite pas à supprimer les lignes droites et rentre directement te reposer ! Elles sont optionnelles, pour garder le corps habitué à des intensités très élevées, mais le principal est de ne pas générer de fatigue inutile ici.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":324,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":190,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":591,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":324,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.833191869661126,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2100,"pace":{"value":324}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":591}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":591}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":591}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":591}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":591}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":190}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":591}},{"kind":"Z2","duration":240,"pace":{"value":324}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - FORCE + AS  - SEMAINE 4 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 2 blocs. Le premier est composé de 5 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second est composé de 3 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'30  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1, et 1' entre les séries du bloc 2. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"N'hésite pas à ajuster l'intensité des exercices en fonction de ta fatigue du jour. Mieux vaut une séance un peu plus légère qui n'impactera pas le reste de ta préparation, que de forcer, de se blesser ou de mal récupérer avant le prochain fractionné.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"maximal","repeat":4,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02