"name":"Gainage dynamique de face à 3 appuies","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730760410-h-bear-crawl.png","muxPlaybackId":"ceTVSnOj5TucqnUU5E7KeL8g300mSrxky","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730760410-h-bear-crawl.png","muxPlaybackId":"zmMnZIrsQjwpFb01qML2U8j6jWwLJ6i3s","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Gainage dynamique de face à 2 appuies","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730761137-h-gainage-face-eleve-2-appuis.png","muxPlaybackId":"Jn01J9qP01W5LfypSNr02SjrtKNhalxN8vd","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730761137-h-gainage-face-eleve-2-appuis.png","muxPlaybackId":"S5E02QrFXDZSQyfax3Fkr02R2NcoGB1S013","format":"mobile"}]}],"gear":"nothing","name":"Gainage Frontal"}},{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Récupération","exerciseType":"recuperation","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"recovery","repeat":1,"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[],"gear":"nothing","name":""}}]}],"status":"todo","difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1794787200000,"sport":"ppg","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":20},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":30},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Le mot d'ordre : relax ! La séance d'endurance fondamentale, c'est celle où il faut en profiter pour se détendre pour permettre la récupération. Le reste de la semaine est rude. Ne tombe pas dans le piège en voulant trop forcer !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":323,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1794787200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.100591715976331,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":323}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45_6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Ajouter des lignes droites en accélération progressive dans les footings, c'est vraiment une bonne manière d'entretenir ta vitesse, de te permettre de courir avec une belle amplitude de mouvement et de travailler à avoir une foulée efficace. En plus ça se fait assez naturellement sur des lignes droites ! Concentre-toi sur le fait de te relâcher... et le reste va suivre !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":323,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":189,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":590,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_4","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":323,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":4,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1794787200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.856894517911467,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2100,"pace":{"value":323}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":189}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":590}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":189}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":590}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":189}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":590}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":189}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":590}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":189}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":590}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":189}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":590}},{"kind":"Z2","duration":240,"pace":{"value":323}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Affutage_42_S1_LONG_150","description":"C'est l'heure de valider ton allure 42 km pour la compétition ! Cette séance test est donc un enchaînement de 2 fractions de 30' à ton allure marathon avec seulement 2' de récupération entre les fractions... Le tout après un \"échauffement\" de 75' pour courir à ton allure marathon en situation de \"pré-fatigue\".","displayName":"Long + Allure 42 km","coachAdvice":"Séance test sur laquelle tu vas devoir avoir l'impression de maîtriser ce que tu fais, d'être \"en contrôle\", tout le long. Le but est de valider que tu es à l'aise à cette allure et que tu te sens capable de courir très longtemps comme ça. Pour ça on te met un long échauffement censé commencer à installer une certaine fatigue... Et t'amener plus proche des conditions de course. Ton allure marathon devrait tout de même te paraître abordable. Et si dans ta tête, tu penses pouvoir courir \"longtemps à cette allure mais pas 42 km\", chasses cette idée, te t'es préparé(e) pour et ça va le faire si l'allure est correcte ! Par contre, si tu trouves cette séance vraiment trop difficile... il vaut mieux ajuster ton allure marathon à la baisse de 10 à 15\"/km maintenant, c'est le bon moment !","test":true,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_75","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":323,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"d